# 18. SENDER ACCOUNT VS INTEGRATION

Preserve this architecture:

```text
Integration
    ↓
Sender Account
    ↓
Campaign / Outreach
```

Integration answers:

> Which email provider connection is this?

Sender Account answers:

> Which identity are we sending from?

Do not merge them.

A single integration may have multiple sender accounts.

